            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ── CTA ────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<div class="adv-cta">
    <div class="container" style="position:relative;z-index:1;">
        <h2>Ready to <span>Start Earning?</span></h2>
        <p>Join thousands of traders who earn cashback on every lot they trade — completely free, no strategy changes needed.</p>
        <div class="adv-hero-btns justify-content-center">
